valence_lowq_vb: the EXACT-SPAN variant VB (N=128 on the MnO 2-f.u. magnetic cell) -- VA plus the
diffuse Mn d 0.18 that VA drops; the O diffuse pair (s 0.15, p 0.18) is dropped as in VA.  The
VA/VB pair is the span BISECTION: the difference between the two rows isolates what the diffuse Mn d
does, in both codes (CP2K puts ~10 mHa of AFM stabilization there -- doc/SphericalLatticePlan.md).
Its CP2K counterpart is VALENCE-LOWQ-SR (Mn) + VALENCE-LOWQ-VB (O), used by mno_{afm2,fm}_gpw_vb.inp.
SPHERICAL-d ARMS ONLY, exactly as its parent.  See valence_lowq_va.bsd for why these are files.

!
